  <item>
    <title>No.141 游鸿明不在热搜，却怎么接住了成年人的痛</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a8c532f1352af56ff3b5526</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a8c532f1352af56ff3b5526</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>很多人是先听见“天空啊下着沙”才认识游鸿明的。</span></p><p><span>但真正听懂他，往往要等你在爱里受过伤、在遗憾里学会沉默之后——才会发现，这个1968年生于台北、从民歌餐厅驻唱走到“音乐诗人”位置的男人，从来不是在唱情歌，是在替成年人写日记。</span></p><p><span>他自己的歌声婉转，也写歌，给自己，也给其他人。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>视频播客：小红书/抖音/bilibili/微博=何必着急</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgRvGzm1xr-nfiAxbemQbuzpcghQ.jpg"><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>节目时间线（歌单）：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">03:58</a> 游鸿明-七月一号</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a> 游鸿明-21个人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="626">10:26</a> 游鸿明-靠近一点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="849">14:09</a> 游鸿明-花蝴蝶</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="979">16:19</a> 游鸿明-喜欢原谅别人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1224">20:24</a> 魔霆痴狂-我们这里还有鱼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1373">22:53</a> 柯以敏-拥抱我</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">25:47</a> 裘海正-爱我的人和我爱的人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">28:45</a> 王力宏/彭羚-让我取暖</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> 蔡健雅-无所谓</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2017">33:37</a> 陈晓东-爱情是一种直觉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2152">35:52</a> 阮丹青-予取予求</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2571">42:51</a> 黄乙玲-无字的情批</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2854">47:34</a> 孙燕姿-坏天气</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3097">51:37</a> 郑秀文-领悟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3268">54:28</a> 锦绣二重唱-一直走一直走</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkA-pO6WSQ1aTKPK6aHRySFz_AgR.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
