  <item>
    <title>No.140 Sorry杨丞琳，原来我欠你一场认真聆听</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a8311978156bf336219c213</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a8311978156bf336219c213</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>做这期播客，像翻一本青春相册——</span></p><p><span>每一张CD背面，都藏着一个不肯认输的杨丞琳。</span></p><p><span>从偶像剧爆款金曲，到常常爆满的演唱会。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>杨丞琳用了 20 年，把歌词里的叙事主语从「你」换成了「我」。</span></p><p><span>从「你不曾发觉」到「经历这个你，活成这个我」。</span></p><p><span>这不是听歌多就能发现的，得把每张专辑的歌摊开来才看得清。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>她走了很远的路，才让我们听懂一句“我是我”。</span></p><p><span>如果你也曾随便定义过她，这期请一定要听。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>视频播客：小红书/B站/抖音/微博（何必着急）</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftncjl7Ob_uaTb6ce7UTX4BtQDNE.jpg"><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>节目时间线：</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>开篇曲：《其实我们值得幸福》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a> 婚后的杨丞琳怎么没了营业动力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">09:28</a> 杨丞琳单飞后的第一张回忆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="776">12:56</a> 杨丞琳的销量一直很稳</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1023">17:03</a> 台湾偶像剧的女主角的性格是“倔强”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 《不见》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1382">23:02</a> 对第三张专辑的微词</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1542">25:42</a> 《学会》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1981">33:01</a> &nbsp;中间的三张专辑转型成功</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2124">35:24</a> 《结痂》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2257">37:37</a> &nbsp;回忆在台北参加杨丞琳新歌发表会</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2792">46:32</a> 《爱，启程》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2996">49:56</a> 歌曲议题和合作音乐人有了很大改变</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3223">53:43</a> tavico喜欢杨丞琳的较真</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3518">58:38</a> 《空空》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3861">64:21</a> 最近的专辑也很有改变的决心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4025">67:05</a> 《仙人掌的花》</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkA-pO6WSQ1aTKPK6aHRySFz_AgR.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/656daddfccfe4124d0dcc182/lrRJ694mA_vXtyZpNh1ZUFxRm_TA.m4a" length="66321315" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:08:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkgJ_ClN6IXn9XALjT9VB7HnFArq.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>No.139 陈辉阳：你爱过、哭过、遗憾过的，都有他的旋律</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a7bdf9836641f136d86e6dc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a7bdf9836641f136d86e6dc</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 02:59:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有些音乐人，我们未必第一时间能叫出他的名字。</span></p><p><span>但只要旋律响起——</span><br><span>你会突然想起某一个人、某一段关系，或者某个已经过去很久的自己。</span></p><p><span>陈辉阳就是这样一个音乐人。</span></p><p><span>他的音乐似乎总有一种能力：不需要太多解释，只需要几个音符，就能让人重新回到某一种心情之中。</span></p><p><span>作为香港流行音乐中极具代表性的作曲人，陈辉阳写过太多属于我们记忆的旋律。</span></p><p><span>他也是用古典音乐的精髓滋润流行音乐的人，让广东歌有了新一番的面貌。</span></p><p><br><span>这一期《何必着急》，我们想把时间交给陈辉阳。</span></p><p><span>重新听一遍那些熟悉的旋律，也重新认识这位藏在无数经典歌曲背后的音乐人。</span></p><p><span>也许多年以后我们才会发现：</span></p><p><span>原来那些我们以为早已忘记的故事，只要一段旋律响起，就会再次浮现。</span></p><p><span>有些歌写的是爱情，</span><br><span>有些旋律记录的，其实是我们自己。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>视频播客同步：小红书/B站/抖音/微博</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlxPYm76qQRQlbLXS6pR4C0qpo-g.jpg"><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>节目时间线：</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">07:05</a> 余力机构-快活在可乐天</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 孙耀威-爱情白皮书</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="776">12:56</a> 蔡依林的出道专辑已经有陈辉阳了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> 李香琴/关淑怡-三千年前</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">24:44</a> 陈奕迅-给爱丽丝</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1798">29:58</a> 容祖儿-怯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 夕+阳=青春四部曲，Y+阳=垃圾五部曲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1981">33:01</a> 傅佩嘉-绝</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2198">36:38</a> 杨千嬅-火鸟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2501">41:41</a> 郑秀文-第二次分手</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a> 梁咏琪-灰姑娘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2898">48:18</a> 卢巧音-喜欢恋爱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3131">52:11</a> 彭羚-我有我天地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3256">54:16</a> 陈辉阳写了很多男女对唱歌曲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3601">60:01</a> 歌手的私生活会不会影响听歌？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3728">62:08</a> 许志安-女人之苦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3914">65:14</a> 古巨基-告别我的恋人们</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4095">68:15</a> 赵学而-难懂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4297">71:37</a> 李蕙敏-闲人勿近</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/656daddfccfe4124d0dcc182/lnD_a1prbcIBtR09SrLz_-Rs2-MJ.m4a" length="70999498" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:13:10</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkgJ_ClN6IXn9XALjT9VB7HnFArq.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>No.138 耳朵友好：2026上半年值得循环的音乐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a72a1131b5e24969ce91815</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a72a1131b5e24969ce91815</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 02:43:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有没有那么一刻——通勤地铁晃过拐角，耳机里突然撞进一句旋律，整个人像被轻轻按了暂停键？这期节目，我们替你跑2026年上半年的听力马拉松：从华语的细腻叙事，到韩流的梦幻回归，再到欧美的松弛表达，横跨时区，挑出最值得塞进播放器的专辑与单曲。不管你是资深乐迷还是随机 shuffle 党，这期都能让你"耳朵中奖"。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>节目视频：小红书、Bilibili、抖音、微博同步上线</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoQZGVNrHRad09hqfUp8TZOJCchV.jpg"><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>节目时间线：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">03:34</a> 周华健-蕾丝花边</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="594">09:54</a> 汤令山Gareth T-偶像已死</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="927">15:27</a> 卢瀚霆-最后一个降落伞</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1237">20:37</a> 郑秀文-陨石与地球</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1481">24:41</a> 陈珊妮-还有人在</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1864">31:04</a> 劣-让我飞吧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2199">36:39</a> Yamy郭颖-过千山</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2404">40:04</a> 李佳隆/王齐铭-节俭说唱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2563">42:43</a> 卫柏Neon-别把我绑架</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2928">48:48</a> IOI-Suddenly</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3080">51:20</a> 吐槽CORTIS演唱会</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3146">52:26</a> COTIS-Acai</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">56:20</a> Miley Cyrus-A Walk Of Fame</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3644">60:44</a> Harry Styles-American Girls</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3813">63:33</a> Olivia Rodrigo-Stupid Song</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4018">66:58</a> Madonna/Sabrina Carpenters-Bring Your Love</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4122">68:42</a> Flight Facilities/Giselle-Crave You</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkA-pO6WSQ1aTKPK6aHRySFz_AgR.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
