  <item>
    <title>No.137 我们爱莫文蔚，但不打算只说好话</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a68a3e656a3f3491ba66858</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a68a3e656a3f3491ba66858</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 12:51:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期，我们不打算做一档"莫文蔚夸夸群"。</span></p><p><span>我们聊了她让我们喜欢的点，也聊了那些让让我们认为"不够莫文蔚"的选择。</span></p><p><span>我们甚至争论了一个问题：如果从头看她的职业生涯，真的是如此单一的形象吗？</span></p><p><span>因为真正的喜欢，不是把她放进一个完美的玻璃罩里供奉——而是愿意走进那些嘈杂、矛盾、不那么舒服的部分，然后发现：哦，原来这就是她之所以是她的原因。</span></p><p><span>我们用一期节目，试着拆开这个被太多形容词包裹的女人。</span></p><p><span>褒也好，贬也罢，说到底，都是因为我们在乎。</span></p><p><span>欢迎收听，这期有点"危险"的莫文蔚特辑。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>视频播客：</span></p><p><span>何必着急（小红书）</span></p><p><span>何必着急-陈稳（BILIBILI）</span></p><p><span>何必着急（抖音）</span></p><p><span>沉山泥（微博）</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkwaPTbW2rM1y9QMbR-8pE0iE7Ch.jpg"><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>节目时间线：</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> &nbsp;开场曲《忐白门》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a> &nbsp;“爱之深责之切”辩论会开始</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="352">05:52</a> &nbsp;莫文蔚经常“撂狠话”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">09:51</a> &nbsp;《我爱你》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> &nbsp;曾经先锋的歌手怎么去了“下沉市场”？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a> &nbsp;莫文蔚一直在兼顾各种市场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1508">25:08</a> &nbsp;《你最爱的歌》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1649">27:29</a> &nbsp;心疼莫文蔚的声带</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1902">31:42</a> &nbsp;莫文蔚的自然自信中年态</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1968">32:48</a> &nbsp;为什么不可以表演古筝？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2072">34:32</a> &nbsp;《While My Guitar Gently Weeps》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2395">39:55</a> &nbsp;喜欢的歌手还在状态是值得幸福的事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2818">46:58</a> &nbsp;《你给我多少时间》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3034">50:34</a> &nbsp;莫文蔚是有本事让一件事成功的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3135">52:15</a> &nbsp;歌手自己的想法很重要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3468">57:48</a> &nbsp;《完美孤独》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3611">60:11</a> &nbsp;莫文蔚有大智慧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3754">62:34</a> &nbsp;《散》</span></p><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkA-pO6WSQ1aTKPK6aHRySFz_AgR.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/656daddfccfe4124d0dcc182/lqhy3yy9xUYw1CUFiCCBh1H_gR0a.m4a" length="63843591" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkgJ_ClN6IXn9XALjT9VB7HnFArq.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
